    "items": [
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7821757?u=e556bee7a71458d488fd58b8216697bbe1d392f5&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Mark <code class=\"notranslate\">transactionId</code> as supported in Firefox 110 for both <code class=\"notranslate\">RTCRtpSender.getParameters()</code> (returned object property) and <code class=\"notranslate\">RTCRtpSender.setParameters()</code> (parameter), where it was previously marked as unsupported.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">transactionId</code> was implemented as part of bringing <code class=\"notranslate\">get/setParameters</code> up to spec in <a href=\"https://bugzil.la/1401592\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1401592</a>, which landed on December 13, 2022. The version bump to Firefox 111 occurred in January 2023, placing this in Firefox 110.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Bugzilla bug: <a href=\"https://bugzil.la/1401592\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzil.la/1401592</a></li>\n<li>Commit: <a href=\"https://hg.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/rev/016eb374b146\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://hg.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/rev/016eb374b146</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">getParameters()</code> generates a unique <code class=\"notranslate\">transactionId</code> UUID on each call, and <code class=\"notranslate\">setParameters()</code> validates that the provided <code class=\"notranslate\">transactionId</code> matches the one from the most recent <code class=\"notranslate\">getParameters()</code> call, rejecting with <code class=\"notranslate\">InvalidModificationError</code> if it does not match.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29099",
            "title": "fix(api): mark RTCRtpSender transactionId as supported in Firefox 110",
            "date_modified": "2026-02-22T15:30:14.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-02-22T15:28:58.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "AnshulMalik",
                "url": "https://github.com/AnshulMalik"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updates Firefox/Safari support for implicit anchor references:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>This was missed, because there are no collector tests.</li>\n<li>In one case, Firefox 141 allegedly added support, but Anchor Positioning only landed in Firefox 147.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #29082.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3964112556\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29082\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29082/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29082\">#29082</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29093",
            "title": "Firefox 147 / Safari 26 support implicit anchor references",
            "date_modified": "2026-02-20T17:38:28.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-02-20T16:22:20.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "caugner",
                "url": "https://github.com/caugner"
            }
